    "custom_collections_community_L76mjK": {
      "type": "custom-collections-community",
      "blocks": {
        "comment_card_JGXVnq": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "\"I love off-roading, and while this car is all-terrain usable, it's still a little bumpy for off-roading, but the comfortable seats make it not so bad!\"",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/off-road-ebike-reviews-a.webp",
            "name": "A.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_rjUzkQ": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "\"I’ve ridden a lot of e-bikes, but the Macfox X1s is easily one of the best for speed, control, and fun. With a 25mph top speed, it’s perfect for any riding terrain. The three throttle levels let you control your speed and power easily, whether you want full motor assist or partial assist with pedaling.One of the coolest things? It can wheelie! Since the bike only weighs 65lbs it's easy to wheelie. Despite being so light, the suspension is excellent, handling rough trails and off-road bumps wit...\"",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/off-road-ebike-reviews-phil-j.webp",
            "name": "Phil J.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_MqFr3i": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "\"Love it!, amazing quality and customer support\"",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/off-road-ebike-reviews-jason-b.webp",
            "name": "Jason B.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_8Rh3CB": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "\"Bike came in and I love it, it’s a super improvement over the Nakto I’ve ridden 30 miles so far, street, off road dirt tracks, trails, and mud. I’m in Illinois so everything is really hilly and the bike handles them great, it’s hard to pedal because the saddle is wide, but there is torque. This is exactly what I wanted, it’s a great starting point because I intend to upgrade to a 72w system but I’m not made of money so I wanted a halfway decent bike for the price, I feel I got that, the throttle response is a tiny bit delayed but not terrible, I’ve also not played with the p settings yet but I will. The breaks aren’t hydraulic but they freaking work, I’m 6’3 230lbs or so and I felt not much drag, I saw a max motor speed of 24 but it is a motor cut off situation so that can be increased, for a 10ah battery I was really impressed with the range of about 15 miles full speed all throttle, I did order the second battery and will add it when it arrives but my future intention is to get at least 1 of the 20ah macfox batteries and then I’ll get something more intense with my 72v system. There is a thumb throttle on this model but it’s a nice and wide one which is very different to the thin one I had on the Nakto. There are 3 pedal assists and the top speed with only the throttle is 1: 11mph 2: 17mph 3: 24 mph, and that may differ slightly based on weight and height. I’ve not ridden or had the bike long enough to give an accurate review but these are my first impressions.\"",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/off-road-ebike-reviews-customer.webp",
            "name": "Customer",
            "product": "x1s-x-bs-zay"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_HahxMa": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“Great bike for my 13 year olds! Arrived very quickly and was easy to assemble (the kids built it themselves). It’s been fun and safe to ride to school and around town.”",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/1_d6dc3ff1-d44b-4c5c-ac32-a21fdc1e0cc9.webp",
            "name": "Erin R.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_keEe34": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“Shopping was way quicker than expected and the bike looks sharp!! My son will be so excited to receive this for his 13th birthday next weekend!”",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/1_a6e73b7b-04f3-40be-9853-0e89b3f6dcab.webp",
            "name": "Krystle F.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_gzLdjU": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“Best bike ever I had all 3 models x1 and x1s and x2 have to say the x2 is a good upgrade definitely worth the extra money !\"",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/2_e4810802-5573-4e7f-8829-e774bb5be5ed.webp",
            "name": "Israel C.",
            "product": "macfox-x2"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_wYa4yn": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“Bought the macfox x7 for my son’s 14th birthday. It’s was super easy to put together. He absolutely loves it! It’s perfect for riding around the neighborhood and going to friends houses.”",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/3_e24db871-3c80-4ae0-8423-dc424412cfee.webp",
            "name": "Laura M.",
            "product": "macfox-x7"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_9h7T6f": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“Love the bike! Very comfortable and I love the brakes and fat tires. It is quite a bit slower to get up to speed compared to all my kids x1 bikes but I do like it. Also the throttle switch does stick quite a bite. But we love our bikes! We have 4 of these EBikes”",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/4_99e8c581-4e66-44e9-bdea-6a0ed7902568.webp",
            "name": "Chris E.",
            "product": "macfox-x7"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_GMciQA": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“We ordered this electric bike on line and it has been great. It was great speed and it has been so helpful for my son to get around with no issues. Also has been very safe for him to use. Also want to mention the amazing Customer Service we have received from Macfox when needed. Paulina has been so responsive and answers are questions on a timely manner. Thank you 😊\"",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/5_c661bb5a-1934-4674-8651-ce479fdfbe51.webp",
            "name": "Catalina G.",
            "product": "macfox-x1"
          }
        },
        "comment_card_4ibE8K": {
          "type": "comment_card",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "comment": "“This bike is super sick! The lower seat height makes it super nice and comfy since I’m a shorter guy. It wheelies straight out of the box super well and the thicker wheels makes it feel like I have full control over the bike. The 13 amp battery gives me 20+ miles of hardcore riding and the brakes have insane stopping power. I would highly recommend buying this awesome bike!\"",
            "img": "shopify://shop_images/6_cf7eb899-5107-49cf-ae55-8921b7254890.webp",
            "name": "Jacob P.",
            "product": "macfox-x7"
          }
        }
      },
